The name in the key blob: "ssh\-ed25519", "ecdsa\-sha2\-nistp256", "ecdsa\-sha2\-nistp384" or "ssh\-rsa".
.TP
const enum gf_sigalg *\fBgf_key_sigalgs\fP (const gf_key *key, size_t *n);
The signature algorithms the key can make, in preference order.  *N receives the count.
.TP
