The public key blob.  The pointer is valid until the key is freed.
.TP
int \fBgf_key_fingerprint\fP (const gf_key *key, char *out, size_t cap);
"SHA256:" and the unpadded base64 of the SHA\-256 of the blob, as ssh\-keygen \-l prints it.  A certificate has the fingerprint of the key it certifies (gf_key_plain_blob), as with ssh\-keygen.  CAP must be at least 51.
